From 28218962228dd90458fd9ea4c5533c233a3acd72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:43:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Hold spend triage for an owned recorded decision

The stale triage timer released budget stops because it only saw older generic triage entries. Budget triage also lacked a notified decision owner. Preserve the stop until promoted_manual/archive, and publish one durable chat-notice or supervisor producer receipt per episode, retrying publication without releasing the hold.

Proof: RED stale-sweep regression reproduced before implementation; tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_spend_budget_hold.py 17 passed; budget suite 20 passed. scripts/check --base origin/main: 20 checks ok. No Inbox delivery; eligibility exemptions remain sibling work.
